where \eqn{\mathcal{A}_{f,t} = \{s : E_{s,f,t} > 0\}} is the set of
active stocks for fleet \eqn{f} at time \eqn{t}.

The targeting weight for each stock is then:

\deqn{
  \delta_{s,f,t} = \frac{E_{s,f,t}}{E_{f,t}}
}

